                    <option value="200-800">Flat Tyre / Puncture Repair (₹200 - ₹800)</option>
                    <option value="250-500">Emergency Fuel Delivery (₹250 + Fuel Cost)</option>
                    <option value="300-1500">Towing Assistance (₹300 - ₹1,500)</option>
